HappyRun Linux portable edition
===============================

Core logic (auto-run.mjs, lib/, capture/happyrun-capture.py, tools/) is based on:

    Fuck-You-HappyRun
    https://github.com/Suzuran28/Fuck-You-HappyRun
    Copyright (c) 2026 Suzuran
    MIT License

Modifications in this repository:

  * Linux/macOS launchers (start.sh, run-formal.sh, watch.mjs, result.mjs)
  * Linux packet capture: nftables transparent mode + proxy mode + CA installer
  * Packaging: removed development scratch files, logs and personal credentials
  * Docs rewritten for Linux

The upstream project is for protocol research / technical exchange only.
